Output out/change-specs.gif
Set Shell bash
Set Width 1180
Set Height 620
Set FontSize 16
Set Padding 12
Set TypingSpeed 35ms

Hide
Type "cd $SPECGETTY_DEMO/projects/harbour-app"
Enter
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "spg --config $SPECGETTY_DEMO/config.yml"
Enter
Sleep 1800ms
Enter
Sleep 1200ms
Right Right Right
Sleep 1800ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Down Down
Sleep 2s
Down
Sleep 2s
Right
Sleep 2s
Right
Sleep 2s
Left Left
Sleep 1500ms
Type "q"
Sleep 400ms
